{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女人是花，世人如是比喻。每朵花都有它的獨特魅力所在，是它的芬芳，是它的型，還是它艷麗？</p><p>其實都是！女人也是一樣，她們的魅力絕對不會只是單一一種，而是千姿百態，每個女人總有她特別吸引人的一個魅力所在，那麼四大血型的女生她們又有什麼魅力呢？且與小編一起細看！</p><p>【延伸閲讀】佢最近唔同咗？4大血型變心預兆　B型成日掛住玩電話可能已有新歡</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閲讀：佢最近唔同咗？4大血型變心預兆　B型成日掛住玩電話可能已有新歡】四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879240777469952348601.jpeg/0VdJxejh9GaMRsrKxR36OXa8k9yPdGui-lvSkPpb0pA\"/><figcaption>【延伸閲讀：佢最近唔同咗？4大血型變心預兆　B型成日掛住玩電話可能已有新歡】四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879243067691008061274.jpeg/HVRLWs8nbK4mkn-HIxT-Am7_Gad-YZIkVbOizlWzos4\"/><figcaption>四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879245215305728820673.jpeg/6iQ_605gyp8WkFWwtujwDEfRq3kduNHkDwAiGg8AIho\"/><figcaption>四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（《阿宅的戀愛太難》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201218/416646769192734720081652.jpeg/Rzs6YCe1I1aS6JU9Zdgljiih7e0Il5qUzrDawM6w2sA\"/><figcaption>（《阿宅的戀愛太難》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879247350337536490618.jpeg/mOkMDOknkU7Qy4kMrOszKJBKqot9MtFQyQmH-skJh_o\"/><figcaption>四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879249355345920980315.jpeg/vra44oWaFJxv8xa17TubZhq_ci2U9lGATafaSU2n2kk\"/><figcaption>四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879251528126464537126.jpeg/60RXS884Xj4_iI6mJsLWZQZWGtdGIzvS3dgKnN3YCpw\"/><figcaption>四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"四大血型的變心預兆。（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201216/415879253721878528348960.jpeg/lJpG_ozwytO8iTTtuOJ8B9Nfz3UL3TtHIOidIyDonSM\"/>